        ("Academic Context", "The system is a prototype-grade project. While designed with production-quality architecture, it has not undergone production hardening (e.g., distributed caching, CDN, container orchestration)."),
        ("Hardware Resources", "The system was developed and tested on standard developer workstations without cloud infrastructure. Performance benchmarks reflect local deployment conditions."),
        ("Database", "The system uses Microsoft SQL Server as the relational database. Cloud database deployment (e.g., Azure SQL) is planned for future work."),
        ("AI Model Training Data", "The health risk prediction model was trained on a synthetic elderly health dataset (elderly_health_dataset.xlsx) of approximately 500 records. Real-world performance may require retraining on larger clinical datasets."),
        ("CORS Policy", "The current development configuration allows all origins (CORS: AllowAll). Production deployment requires a restricted CORS policy aligned to the hosting domain."),
        ("Fall Detection", "The current fall detection module uses a bounding-box aspect-ratio heuristic as a simulation prototype. Integration with a real computer vision model (e.g., YOLOv8-pose, MediaPipe) is planned for future work."),
        ("Authentication", "The system implements stateless JWT authentication with a 60-minute access token. Refresh token rotation is planned for a future version."),
    ]
    add_styled_table(doc, ["Constraint", "Description"], constraints)

