    add_heading(doc, "3.5.3  Emergency Health Alert Workflow", 3)
    add_paragraph(doc, """
[AI Microservice Receives Vital Signs Data]
         │
         ▼
[Apply Clinical Rule Engine]
         │
    ┌────┴────────────────────────┐
    │  BP ≥ 160 OR HR ≥ 115 OR   │
    │  Temp ≥ 101.5°F OR         │
    │  Blood Sugar ≥ 200 mg/dL   │
    │  OR Missed Meds ≥ 2        │
    └───────────────┬────────────┘
         │ ANY TRUE │
         ▼
[Force Risk = HIGH | Confidence = 0.99]
         │
         ▼
[Generate Urgent Clinical Alert Report (Markdown)]
         │
         ▼
[Return {risk: "High", recommendation: URGENT_REPORT}]
         │
         ▼
[Backend: Check Risk Level]
         │
[if High → NotificationService.CreateNotification()]
         │
         ▼
[Persist Notification to DB]
         │
         ▼
[SignalR: Push real-time alert to Team Leaders]
         │
         ▼
[Team Leader receives HealthAlert notification]
         │
         ▼
[Team Leader opens report → Reads clinical recommendations]
         │
         ▼
[Initiates appropriate intervention]
         │
        [END]

Figure 3.12: Activity Diagram – Emergency Health Alert Detection and Escalation
""", size=8)

