        "A Google Gemini AI integration that generates professional narrative daily care reports from structured health metrics.",
        "A real-time SignalR notification system delivering instant alerts for health events and workflow decisions.",
        "A complete report submission, review, and approval workflow between employees and team leaders.",
        "A family-facing portal providing transparent, secure access to approved health reports and visit scheduling.",
